    content: [
      "## Herkesin ba\u015f\u0131na gelen sorun",
      "Telefonunuz harika foto\u011fraflar \u00e7ekiyor. Sonra \u00fc\u00e7 foto\u011fraf\u0131 e-postayla g\u00f6ndermeye \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorsunuz ve i\u015flem tak\u0131l\u0131yor.",
      "Sorun telefonunuzda de\u011fil. O harika foto\u011fraflar\u0131n her biri 6-8 MB \u2014 g\u00fcnl\u00fck kullan\u0131m\u0131n \u00e7o\u011fu i\u00e7in fazla a\u011f\u0131r.",
      "\u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm daha k\u00f6t\u00fc foto\u011fraf \u00e7ekmek de\u011fil. Kullanmadan \u00f6nce ak\u0131ll\u0131ca s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak.",
      "## S\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma ger\u00e7ekte ne yap\u0131yor?",
      "Bir JPEG'i %80 kalitede s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak, bilgisayara \u015funu s\u00f6ylemektir: \"G\u00f6z\u00fcm\u00fcn fark etmeyece\u011fi g\u00f6rsel bilgiyi at.\"",
      "Bir foto\u011fraf, ekran\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n g\u00f6sterebilece\u011finden \u00e7ok daha fazla detay i\u00e7erir. S\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma algoritmalar\u0131 bunu ac\u0131mas\u0131zca kullan\u0131r: ince renk ge\u00e7i\u015fleri, y\u00fcksek frekansl\u0131 detaylar \u2014 piksel avc\u0131s\u0131 bir foto\u011fraf\u00e7\u0131 i\u00e7in \u00f6nemli, telefonda foto\u011fraf\u0131n\u0131za bakan biri i\u00e7in \u00f6nemsiz \u015feyler.",
      "%80'de tipik bir foto\u011fraf, g\u00f6zle g\u00f6r\u00fcl\u00fcr fark olmadan %60-70 k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fcl\u00fcr. \u0130nternetteki her g\u00f6rsel zaten b\u00f6yle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor \u2014 Instagram, Amazon, hepsi s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131yor. Siz sadece kontrol\u00fc geri al\u0131yorsunuz.",
      "## Sunucu sorunu (kimsenin konu\u015fmad\u0131\u011f\u0131)",
      "\u00c7o\u011fu \u00fccretsiz s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131, g\u00f6rsellerinizi sunucular\u0131na y\u00fckler. Tatil foto\u011fraf\u0131 i\u00e7in fark etmez. Kimlik belgesi, gizlilik s\u00f6zle\u015fmeli m\u00fc\u015fteri foto\u011fraflar\u0131 veya evinizin GPS verisini i\u00e7eren g\u00f6rseller i\u00e7in iki kez d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn.",
      "Alternatif: tamamen taray\u0131c\u0131n\u0131zda \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan ara\u00e7lar. G\u00f6rsel cihaz\u0131n\u0131zdan asla \u00e7\u0131kmaz. Taray\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n Canvas API'si her \u015feyi yerel olarak yapar. Geli\u015ftirici ara\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131n A\u011f sekmesinden on saniyede do\u011frulayabilirsiniz.",
      "## JPEG, PNG, WebP: 30 saniyede karar",
      "**JPEG** foto\u011fraflar i\u00e7in. Evrensel. %75-85 kalite.",
      "**PNG** metin i\u00e7eren grafikler, logolar, ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleri i\u00e7in. Keskin kenarlar\u0131 ve \u015feffafl\u0131\u011f\u0131 korur.",
      "**WebP** modern web i\u00e7in. Ayn\u0131 kalitede JPEG'den %25-30 daha k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck. T\u00fcm g\u00fcncel taray\u0131c\u0131lar destekler.",
      "## \u00dc\u00e7 durum, \u00fc\u00e7 cevap",
      "**\u0130\u015f ba\u015fvurusu, foto\u011fraf 200 KB ile s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 m\u0131?** JPEG olarak %70 kalitede s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. Yetecektir.",
      "**Web sitesi \u00e7ok mu yava\u015f?** T\u00fcm g\u00f6rsellerinizi %80 kalitede WebP'ye \u00e7evirin. PageSpeed'iniz \u2014 ve Google \u2014 te\u015fekk\u00fcr edecek.",
      "**Depolama doldu mu?** Foto\u011fraf ar\u015fivinizi %75 kalitede s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. G\u00f6zle g\u00f6r\u00fcl\u00fcr fark olmadan %60 alan kazan\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z.",
      "## Kalite konusunda endi\u015felenmeli miyim?",
      "%80'de, normal ekranda, normal izleme mesafesinde: hay\u0131r. K\u00f6r testte profesyonel tasar\u0131mc\u0131lar bile orijinal ile s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f\u0131 ay\u0131rt etmekte zorlan\u0131yor.",
      "G\u00f6rsellerinizi bozmuyorsunuz. Profesyonel web'in y\u0131llard\u0131r yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 yap\u0131yorsunuz."
    ]
